Package: LandScriptDeforestMap
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Deforestation Analysis Using Classified Images
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thiago", "Lappicy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lappicy@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Provides an updated workflow for evaluating deforestation and
    land-cover changes from classified remote sensing images. It creates
    spatial meshes, summarizes raster classes, calculates annual variations,
    produces graphics and maps, and includes an interactive R Shiny
    application.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Lappicy/LandScriptDeforestMap
BugReports: https://github.com/Lappicy/LandScriptDeforestMap/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
